  - Assess risk of bias across domains; derive an overall judgment.
  - Synthesize findings narratively; if data are sufficiently homogeneous, consider pooled estimates or range of 
effects.
  - Evaluate certainty of evidence (qualitative assessment aligned with risk of bias and consistency).

